WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.491 --> 00:00:13.133
was once a fox who lived in the forest.

2
00:00:13.653 --> 00:00:16.014
He was a clever and cunning fox.

3
00:00:16.535 --> 00:00:18.756
He could easily fool anyone.

4
00:00:20.918 --> 00:00:26.782
One day, a tiger saw the fox and thought, "He will make a tasty meal.

5
00:00:27.502 --> 00:00:29.884
I will eat the little fox for dinner."

6
00:00:30.612 --> 00:00:32.893
The tiger snuck up on the fox.

7
00:00:35.595 --> 00:00:39.197
The tiger opened his mouth and was about to eat the fox.

8
00:00:39.878 --> 00:00:41.819
But the fox yelled, "Stop!

9
00:00:42.319 --> 00:00:43.280
How dare you!

10
00:00:43.800 --> 00:00:45.061
Do not touch me.

11
00:00:45.901 --> 00:00:47.622
I am the King of the Forest."

12
00:00:50.104 --> 00:00:52.065
The tiger stopped and chuckled.

13
00:00:52.085 --> 00:00:54.166
"Ha-ha! You?

14
00:00:55.026 --> 00:00:57.308
You are not the King of the Forest.

15
00:00:58.024 --> 00:01:00.745
You are just a small, silly fox."

16
00:01:01.365 --> 00:01:07.087
The fox knew he was not the King of the Forest, but he planned to trick the tiger.

17
00:01:11.708 --> 00:01:14.309
am! I'm the King of the Forest.

18
00:01:14.829 --> 00:01:15.969
And I can prove it."

19
00:01:16.469 --> 00:01:18.730
"You are not the King of the Forest.

20
00:01:19.470 --> 00:01:22.891
All I see is a little fox," said the tiger.

21
00:01:24.711 --> 00:01:26.232
The fox thought quickly.

22
00:01:26.868 --> 00:01:30.449
Because he was very clever, he soon had a plan.

23
00:01:30.469 --> 00:01:35.771
"Truly, I am the King of the Forest.

24
00:01:36.411 --> 00:01:39.472
When the other animals see me, they run away."

25
00:01:39.492 --> 00:01:42.653
"They run away from you?

26
00:01:42.673 --> 00:01:47.434
Ha-ha-ha! No one runs away from you.

27
00:01:48.234 --> 00:01:54.276
You are a silly, skinny fox," laughed the tiger.

28
00:01:55.956 --> 00:01:59.277
The fox knew that the deer were afraid of the tiger.

29
00:01:59.898 --> 00:02:03.099
So he said, "Let's go see the deer.

30
00:02:03.759 --> 00:02:04.940
They will run away."

31
00:02:06.780 --> 00:02:09.562
The fox and the tiger went to see the deer.

32
00:02:10.162 --> 00:02:13.303
When the deer saw the tiger, they ran away.

33
00:02:13.323 --> 00:02:15.084
"Run, run!

34
00:02:15.564 --> 00:02:18.485
It is the King of the Forest," cried the deer.

35
00:02:18.505 --> 00:02:20.826
"Look at them.

36
00:02:21.466 --> 00:02:22.667
They are afraid of me.

37
00:02:23.647 --> 00:02:26.809
I am the King of the Forest," said the fox.

38
00:02:26.829 --> 00:02:31.191
"Hmm? I still don't believe you.

39
00:02:31.932 --> 00:02:35.514
You are just a little fox," the tiger said.

40
00:02:35.534 --> 00:02:38.096
"Let's go see the monkeys.

41
00:02:38.736 --> 00:02:41.658
They will run away too," said the fox.

42
00:02:43.879 --> 00:02:47.101
So the fox and the tiger went to see the monkeys.

43
00:02:47.762 --> 00:02:51.064
When the monkeys saw the tiger, they ran away.

44
00:02:52.669 --> 00:02:53.690
"Swing, swing!

45
00:02:54.150 --> 00:02:57.533
It's the King of the Forest," they said.

46
00:02:57.553 --> 00:03:01.717
"They are afraid of you!"

47
00:03:02.238 --> 00:03:03.219
the tiger said.

48
00:03:03.239 --> 00:03:05.120
"Of course they are.

49
00:03:05.901 --> 00:03:07.523
I am the King of the Forest.

50
00:03:08.383 --> 00:03:11.686
All animals are afraid of me," boasted the fox.

51
00:03:12.427 --> 00:03:14.269
The tiger believed the fox.

52
00:03:14.889 --> 00:03:17.192
Now he was afraid of the fox too.

53
00:03:20.396 --> 00:03:23.318
"I am so sorry, my great king.

54
00:03:23.979 --> 00:03:25.800
Please do not hurt me!"

55
00:03:25.820 --> 00:03:33.806
"I will let you go, but you must never try to hurt me again," said the fox.

56
00:03:35.327 --> 00:03:38.129
The tiger thanked the fox and bowed to him.

57
00:03:38.149 --> 00:03:42.392
"My king, I will never hurt you again.

58
00:03:43.213 --> 00:03:45.934
You are a furious, furry fox."

59
00:03:45.954 --> 00:03:50.069
"You may go," said the fox smiling.

60
00:03:52.411 --> 00:03:56.593
That night, the fox told all his friends about the tiger.

61
00:03:57.374 --> 00:04:00.456
The fox and his friends laughed and laughed.
